# Cursor Rules for clean-python-craft
Use when designing, writing, refactoring, or reviewing Python systems where high-level intent, mathematical models, or domain logic must translate into clean, type-safe, scale-invariant, and maintainable code. Enforces protocols, Pydantic v2 boundaries, coordinate-aware multidimensional data, algorithmic preconditioning, and explicit failure semantics inspired by scientific production architectures.

